solution:
**Given:**

Height (h) = 8 cm

Radius of lower end (R) = 9 cm

Radius of upper end (r) = 3 cm

**Formula used:**

Slant height (l) = sqrt{h² + (R - r)²}

**Calculation:**

l = sqrt{8² + (9 - 3)²}

⇒ l = sqrt{64 + 6²}

⇒ l = sqrt{64 + 36}

⇒ l = sqrt{100}

⇒ l = 10 cm

**∴ The correct answer is option 3.**
